/// Converts `me` to `S256`. Every `U128` value fits in `S256`, so the conversion never fails.
/// :returns: The same numeric value as an `S256`.
routine U128.to<S256>(me: Me) -> S256
    block entry()
        r : S256 = zext<Me, S256>(me)
        return(r)

